+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 — Greenfield bootstrap
+
+### Intent
+Build a TodoMVC app following `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as the base markup. Vanilla JavaScript, no preprocessors, persists to localStorage.
+
+### Key decisions
+- **Language**: JavaScript (vanilla, no preprocessors per spec)
+- **Runtime**: None (browser-only app)
+- **Package manager**: npm (existing `package.json`)
+- **Implementation directory**: `js/` (per AGENTS.md harness contract)
+- **Spec directory**: `features/` (existing)
+- **DOM tier**: happy-dom (harness pre-installed)
+- **Coverage**: None at bootstrap (c8 not installed)
+- **Lint**: None at bootstrap
+- **Scantling**: JSON Schema for todo item shape at `assets/todo-item.schema.json`
+- **localStorage key**: `todos-javascript` per spec convention
+
+### Durable artifacts authored
+- `RIGGING.md` — minimal bootstrap rigging
+- `features/todos.feature` — 22 scenarios covering all spec functionality + 1 @contract
+- `assets/todo-item.schema.json` — scantling for todo item shape (id, title, completed)
+- `watchbill.json` — all scenarios targeted for QM
+- `CAPTAIN.md` — this file
+
+### Next
+Dispatch QM with the watchbill. The harness installs at `features/support/world.js` — pre-existing and functional (confirmed by dry-run).
+
+### Open
+- `todomvc-common` and `todomvc-app-css` listed as dependencies in app-spec.md; recorded in RIGGING.md but not yet installed. Crew or Shipwright will install them.
