+Feature: Todo Application
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a todo list
+  So that I can keep track of tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Visual state when empty
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Then "#main" should not be visible
+    And "#footer" should not be visible
+
+  Rule: Creating todos
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then I should see "Buy milk" in the todo list
+    And the new todo input should be cleared
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace in new todo is trimmed
+    When I type "   Buy milk   " into the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then I should see "Buy milk" in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Empty todo is ignored
+    When I type "" into the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should remain empty
+
+  Rule: Toggling completion
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I click the toggle for "Buy milk"
+    Then "Buy milk" should be marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as completed
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    When I click the "Mark all as complete" toggle
+    Then all todos should be marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Mark-all checkbox reflects individual completions
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    When I mark "Buy milk" as completed
+    And I mark "Walk dog" as completed
+    Then the "Mark all as complete" checkbox should be checked
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+  Scenario: Double-click a todo to enter editing mode
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I double-click "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo should be in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Save an edited todo on Enter
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I double-click "Buy milk"
+    And I change the value to "Buy organic milk" and press Enter
+    Then I should see "Buy organic milk" in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Save an edited todo on blur
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I double-click "Buy milk"
+    And I change the value to "Buy organic milk" and blur the input
+    Then I should see "Buy organic milk" in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Discard edit on Escape
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I double-click "Buy milk"
+    And I change the value to "Buy organic milk" and press Escape
+    Then I should see "Buy milk" in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Destroy todo when edit is emptied
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I double-click "Buy milk"
+    And I clear the edit input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Rule: Counter
+
+  Scenario: Display active todo count
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    Then the todo count should show "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Pluralize item count
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the todo count should show "1 item left"
+    When I create a todo "Walk dog"
+    Then the todo count should show "2 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then "Buy milk" should not appear in the todo list
+    And "Walk dog" should appear in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no completed todos exist
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the "Clear completed" button should not be visible
+
+  Rule: Routing and filtering
+
+  Scenario: Show all todos by default
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    Then I should see 2 todos
+
+  Scenario: Filter to active todos
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I click the "Active" filter
+    Then I should see 1 todo
+    And it should be "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Filter to completed todos
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I click the "Completed" filter
+    Then I should see 1 todo
+    And it should be "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Active filter link has selected class
+    When I click the "Active" filter
+    Then the "Active" filter link should have class "selected"
+    And the "All" filter link should not have class "selected"
+
+  Rule: Persistence to localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Persist todos across reload
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I reload the app
+    Then I should see "Buy milk" in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Persist completion state across reload
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I reload the app
+    Then "Buy milk" should be marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Persist active filter across reload
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    When I click the "Active" filter
+    And I reload the app
+    Then I should see only active todos
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: The todo item conforms to the todo-item schema
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the localStorage todo items conform to the "todo-item" schema in "assets/todo-item.schema.json"
